4383: \medskip
4384: \noindent\emph{Verification.} The three verifier logs and the venue/bibliography live-check log are finite
4385: files in the supplemental bundle, and their commands are the only fresh
4386: command-run surfaces listed in
4387: Table~\ref{tab:command-boundary-inventory}.  Each log records its command,
