4391: dated 2026-06-05 local-date route and bibliography query tuple.  That digest manifest
4392: records the selected support mode, namely conditional exact supplemental
4393: inclusion of \path{review_bundle/}, and gives SHA-256 digests for the finite
4394: certificate surfaces of the package, including all four command-run logs.  Thus
4395: the byte identity of the files carrying
4396: the command-result claims is not determined by a mutable phrase such as a local
